## TL;DR

- Always verify the **real sender**, not just the display name.
- Check **headers**, **HTML/source**, and **actual link destinations**.
- Watch for **URL shortening**, **tracking pixels**, and **multi-stage redirects**.
- Treat **PDF**, **.dot**, and **.xlsx** attachments as suspicious if they do not match the context.
- Look for signs of **credential harvesting** and **brand impersonation**.
- Common indicators include **urgency**, **BCC**, **sender mismatch**, and **context inconsistencies**.
- Never directly interact with suspicious links, domains, IPs, or attachments. [Source](https://www.genspark.ai/api/files/s/XGYe0Whz)

