## Red Flags Table

| Red Flag | What It Looks Like | Why It Is Suspicious | Example |
|---|---|---|---|
| Sender mismatch | Display name does not match real sender | Brand spoofing | Fake PayPal sender |
| BCC usage | User missing from `To` field | Mass phishing indicator | Hidden recipients |
| Urgency | “Action Required”, “Account On Hold” | Pressures quick reaction | Billing / shipment alert |
| Blank body | Empty message with only attachment | Avoids content-based detection / shifts lure to file | Apple-themed sample |
| Wrong file type | Template or spreadsheet in odd context | File does not fit business purpose | `.dot` / `.xlsx` |
| Hidden link target | Button text differs from destination | Link manipulation | Tracking or payment link |
| Mixed context | Geography/language mismatch | Template reuse or fraud | German domain + Indian address + Mandarin text |
| Brand-heavy design | Strong logos and HTML branding | Designed to create trust | Microsoft / DHL / PayPal styling | [Source](https://www.genspark.ai/api/files/s/XGYe0Whz)

