## Gotchas

| Gotcha | Why It Tricks People | Correct Response |
|---|---|---|
| Trusted display name | Looks official at first glance | Check the real sender |
| Shortened links | Hide the destination | Trace safely, do not click |
| Blank-body email | Looks minimal and clean | Inspect attachment and headers |
| PDF attachment | Often assumed safe | Check for embedded links |
| Good grammar | Can appear legitimate | Do not rely only on typos |
| Famous logos | Create instant trust | Validate domain and redirect path |
| Opening the email | May trigger tracking | Avoid loading remote content |
| BCC usage | Easy to overlook | Review recipient handling | [Source](https://www.genspark.ai/api/files/s/XGYe0Whz)

